  "title": "Exotic Silky Peruvian Fish Ceviche Clasico",
  "description": "A funky and silky Peruvian dish featuring pickle juice and deglaze fond, perfect for a solo dinner, this lacto vegetarian friendly ceviche clasico is a unique twist on traditional ceviche.",
