  "instructions": [
    "Cut the halibut fillets into small pieces and place them in a large bowl.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the pickle juice, lime juice, and vegetarian Worcestershire sauce.",
    "Add the mixed juice to the bowl with the halibut and make sure the fish is completely covered.",
    "Add the thinly sliced red onion, chopped aji amarillo pepper, and minced garlic to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the fish to marinate.",
    "Just before serving, stir in the chopped fresh cilantro and deglaze fond.",
    "Season the ceviche with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the ceviche clasico immediately, garnished with additional cilantro if desired."
  ],
